WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.950
Step four plans the program's files against
an export of the tenant's workflows.

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.238
The day-one workflow changed,
so it gets a new version.

3
00:00:08.238 --> 00:00:12.576
The employee last-day leaver isn't
in the tenant yet, so it's a create.

4
00:00:12.576 --> 00:00:15.213
The other four are
unchanged and left alone.

5
00:00:15.213 --> 00:00:20.176
There's one warning, J W fifteen, for
a workflow called Onboard Marketing,

6
00:00:20.176 --> 00:00:24.213
legacy: someone made it in the
portal, and no file defines it.

7
00:00:24.213 --> 00:00:27.537
The plan is written to a
file, and nothing is sent.

8
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:29.600
Now try planning the broken folder.

9
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.313
It stops with an error: the files have
lint findings, fix them before planning.

10
00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:36.024
So the order is enforced.

11
00:00:36.024 --> 00:00:39.530
Lint first, then plan,
then a reviewed send.
